1. CORRECT LOCAL MODEL CLAIMS
   ================================================================

Upgrade-13 reports:

LOCAL_MODEL_ROUTE: PASS

Do not accept this merely because model metadata exists.

Prove separately:

provider discovery
model discovery
model metadata
chat inference
streaming
tool calling
structured output
cancellation
timeout
error mapping

where actually supported.

Do not force one model to support every feature.

================================================================
2. WEB PRODUCT EVIDENCE CORRECTION
==================================

Upgrade-13 reports Web tests as optional while WEB_PRODUCT reports PASS.

Define release-profile semantics:

CORE_FREE
CLI_ONLY
SELF_HOSTED_WEB
SAAS

If SELF_HOSTED_WEB is claimed:

Web dependencies and Web tests must execute.

A skipped web test cannot provide E2 evidence.

Correct previous report/gate if necessary.

================================================================
3. LOCAL MODEL PROVIDER PROTOCOL
================================

Create or consolidate:

LocalModelProvider

Interface concept:

list_models()
show_model()
health()
chat()
stream_chat()
embed()
capabilities()
cancel()

Do not make Ollama-specific JSON the domain model.

================================================================
4. OLLAMA ADAPTER
=================

Implement a clean Ollama adapter against current official local API.

Audit current documentation first.

Support only documented behavior.

At minimum verify:

health / connectivity
model listing
model details
chat/generation
streaming

Use model capability metadata where available.

Do not require Ollama Cloud.

Local mode must not require:

OLLAMA_API_KEY

================================================================
5. REAL OLLAMA TEST
===================

Create separately identifiable integration test.

Example marker:

pytest -m ollama_local

Test must connect to an actual local Ollama server.

Verify:

list models
select installed model
small inference
stream terminal event
token/runtime metadata where available

Do not automatically download a multi-GB model in default CI.

If no model installed:

report:

LOCAL_RUNTIME_AVAILABLE
MODEL_NOT_AVAILABLE

not:

PASS

