42. SECRET-AWARE INDEXING
=========================

Before embedding content:

apply secret/path policy.

Never embed detected credentials merely for retrieval.

================================================================
43. LOCAL INDEX BACKEND
=======================

Prefer simple local solution first.

Possible:

SQLite metadata
local vector/index file
in-process nearest-neighbor library

Do not introduce hosted vector DB.

Do not introduce heavy vector infrastructure without need.

================================================================
44. VECTOR BACKEND INTERFACE
============================

Abstract:

VectorStore

LocalVectorStore first.

External adapters optional.

================================================================
45. INCREMENTAL INDEXING
========================

Use file hashes.

Only reindex changed files.

Support deletion cleanup.

================================================================
46. INDEX IDENTITY
==================

Index key must include:

repository
commit/worktree
embedding model/version

Do not accidentally reuse stale index for unrelated branch.

================================================================
47. BRANCH AWARENESS
====================

Agent worktree changes may invalidate source index.

Support incremental update during coding job.

================================================================
48. RETRIEVAL
=============

RAG should retrieve bounded relevant chunks.

Do not dump entire repository into context.

================================================================
49. HYBRID RETRIEVAL
====================

Consider local hybrid:

symbol/path/text
+
embedding similarity

Do not rely exclusively on vector similarity for code.

================================================================
50. CODE-AWARE SEARCH
=====================

Use cheap deterministic signals:

filename
symbol
imports
grep/text

before embeddings where appropriate.

================================================================
51. RAG COST POLICY
===================

Local RAG must make zero paid calls under zero-cost policy.

Hosted embedding fallback forbidden unless explicitly allowed.

