================================================================
71. TOOL CAPABILITY REQUIREMENTS
================================

Routing must know:

task requires tools

If selected local model cannot reliably call tools:

either choose another free model

or use a controlled alternative workflow.

Do not blindly send tool schema.

================================================================
72. TOOL CALL REPAIR
====================

If local model emits malformed tool arguments:

support bounded repair.

Do not loop forever.

================================================================
73. TOOL CALL VALIDATION
========================

Always validate against schema before execution.

Never execute model-generated shell/tool payload directly without tool
boundary.

