===================

Example:

LOCAL_PROVIDER_CONTRACT: PASS E2
LOCAL_MODEL_DISCOVERY: PASS E2
LOCAL_MODEL_REAL: NOT_TESTED

ZERO_PAID_CALLS: PASS E3

LOCAL_RAG: PASS E3
MCP_LOCAL: PASS E3

AUTONOMOUS_LOCAL_PIPELINE:
E3 with FakeLocalModel
E4 only if real model executed

Do not merge evidence tiers.

================================================================
128. RELEASE PROFILE
====================

CORE_FREE can PASS without actual heavyweight real model in CI if:

provider contracts
offline pipeline
zero paid calls

are proven.

But report:

REAL_LOCAL_MODEL = NOT_TESTED

until executed.

================================================================
129. E4 LOCAL RELEASE PROFILE
=============================

Optionally define:

LOCAL_AI_VERIFIED

Requires actual local model server + inference.

This is stronger than CORE_FREE.

