131. VERSION DECISION
=====================

Inspect actual published release history.

Upgrade-14 is a significant new self-hosted AI subsystem.

Select appropriate SemVer.

Do not keep 1.40.0 automatically merely because previous unreleased
iterations did.

Explain:

published state
API compatibility
CLI compatibility
DB compatibility
new feature surface

================================================================
132. REQUIRED COMMANDS
======================

Run:

python -m pytest -q -ra

python main.py --version
python main.py --help

python -m build

clean wheel install

zcoder --version

git diff --check

Run separately:

offline E2E
zero-paid-call E2E
local provider contracts
hardware profiler
RAG
MCP
local agent pipeline
self-hosted Web tests

Run actual Ollama/vLLM tests if environment supports them.

Never fake their execution.

================================================================
133. DEFINITION OF DONE
=======================

Upgrade-14 is complete only when:

[ ] Upgrade-13 local-model evidence is corrected
[ ] Web release-profile evidence is corrected
[ ] local provider abstraction exists
[ ] Ollama adapter exists
[ ] vLLM/local OpenAI adapter exists
[ ] discovery is bounded to trusted endpoints
[ ] model metadata is normalized
[ ] capabilities include evidence source
[ ] CPU-only mode works
[ ] hardware profiler works
[ ] router considers hardware
[ ] zero-cost route never selects UNKNOWN/PAID
[ ] fallback cannot silently spend
[ ] benchmark engine exists
[ ] benchmark results include hardware/model identity
[ ] local embeddings exist
[ ] local repository index exists
[ ] indexing excludes secrets
[ ] RAG is branch/model aware
[ ] MCP implementation audited against current specification
[ ] local MCP server can execute
[ ] MCP tools use ZCoder policy
[ ] MCP cannot bypass secret/network policy
[ ] local agent runtime exists independent of paid provider SDK
[ ] bounded local tool loop exists
[ ] autonomous coding pipeline runs offline
[ ] zero-paid-call assertion passes
[ ] no external paid dependency required
[ ] real local runtime evidence is reported honestly
[ ] inherited tenant/security tests remain green

