## 26. Final Verdict

Do not say:

FULLY LOCAL AI VERIFIED

if only FakeRuntime was tested.

Do not say:

GPU SUPPORTED

unless actual hardware/runtime evidence exists.

Do not say:

OLLAMA VERIFIED

if only HTTP adapter mocks ran.

Do not say:

ZERO PAID COST

unless the tested autonomous execution produced zero commercial
provider transport calls.

The target is not feature count.

The target is:

a real coding workflow can run entirely on hardware controlled by the
user with no mandatory commercial API dependency.
